.MARINE...
(Today through Sunday)
Issued at 1029 AM PDT Tue Sep 15 2026

Northwesterly winds diminish across the inner and southern
coastal waters today with a moderate breeze and occasional fresh
gusts prevailing through late week. Strong northwesterly winds
diminish more slowly across the northern outer waters with
hazardous conditions continuing into Wednesday. Rough seas linger
through Wednesday before seas abate and become moderate.

